## Prerequisites
* JDK 25
* Docker and Docker Compose

## Using Taskfile
Install JDK, Maven, Gradle,  etc using [SDKMAN](https://sdkman.io/)

```shell
$ curl -s "https://get.sdkman.io" | bash
$ source "$HOME/.sdkman/bin/sdkman-init.sh"
$ sdk env install
```

```shell
# runs all tests
$ task test

# formats java code using spotless
$ task format

# builds docker image
$ task build_image

# starts app using docker compose
$ task start
$ task stop
$ task restart
```

## Using mise

[mise](https://mise.jdx.dev/) can install the required SDKs (Java, Maven) and run tasks defined in `mise.toml`.

```shell
# Trust the project's mise.toml (one-time)
$ mise trust

# Install the SDKs (Java 25 Temurin, Maven)
$ mise install

# List available tasks
$ mise tasks

# Format code and run tests
$ mise run format
$ mise run test

# Run verification checks
$ mise run verify

# Build docker image
$ mise run build_image

# Run application in docker container
$ mise run start
$ mise run stop
$ mise run restart
```